From 23ac6e441fd0cc761f05e30b619b8633fc657d84 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mikolaj Klikowicz <mklikowicz@antmicro.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Jan 2026 17:11:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 26/36] instrumentation: Add tracing subsystem transport
 backend
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

This commit adds support for sending instrumentation events via the
tracing subsystem instead of directly to a UART.

The transport of choice can be configured from Kconfig.

Signed-off-by: Mikolaj Klikowicz <mklikowicz@antmicro.com>
Signed-off-by: Łukasz Kędziora <lkedziora@antmicro.com>
